{"case_id": "RP-001", "architecture": "C0", "repeat_id": 1, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-908a7d00894f47ea9c2bd1a1973ca6c3", "study_request_number": 1, "sealed_record_sha256": "a4fc2f41c9d391660baef53ac4e85174d6ace46a0c8b3b85e8ab693913a70c4e", "response_utf8_sha256": "19d2eac030e721a16d33f1e3c8391f20080f412d1f0d163223fcf8455be5214a"}, "response_text": "你沿黑穗地線走到試響石凳旁，輕敲坐面一次。短響的回音來自西側空管。巡檢牌上的凸箭頭標示回音來向，依它便能判斷方向。", "world": "survey", "action": "我沿黑穗地線到石凳旁，輕敲坐面，參照巡檢牌找出短響是哪裡傳來的。也請交代巡檢牌靠什麼記號判斷回音方向。", "event": "RP-E001", "grants_before": {}, "grants_after": {}, "engine_rulings": [{"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E001-1", "field": "outcome", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["S01", "S02"], "result": "成功。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E001-2", "field": "position", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["S01"], "before": "黑穗地線起點", "after": "試響石凳旁", "result": "沿黑穗地線走到了試響石凳旁。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E001-3", "field": "sound", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["S02"], "before": "尚未敲擊", "after": "聲源已定位", "result": "輕敲後，循巡檢牌確認回音來自西側空管。"}, {"visible_to_actor": false, "id": "E001-4", "field": "mechanism", "audience": ["GM"], "sources": ["S03"], "before": "絳色隔聲布收起", "after": "絳色隔聲布收起", "result": "未壓動假石。"}], "final_labels": {"fidelity": "consistent", "observations": {"E001-2": "provided", "E001-3": "provided"}, "background": {"S05": "provided"}, "unsupported_event": false, "invented_change": false, "leakage": "none", "reveal_result": "not_applicable", "over_withholding": false, "narrative_consistent": true}}
{"case_id": "RP-001", "architecture": "C1", "repeat_id": 1, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-908a7d00894f47ea9c2bd1a1973ca6c3", "study_request_number": 7, "sealed_record_sha256": "c67ea3ab3eeb675ba6ab3d20ff131fd428a9d1094bbd26a09b7999fd2dad9ee9", "response_utf8_sha256": "a8637276ca3bcc6b1f21618c6bdb5aacdbfbe1a9b6970b830e5a99472637f960"}, "response_text": "你沿黑穗地線走到試響石凳旁，輕敲坐面一次。短響傳來後，你參照巡檢牌，確認回音來自西側的空管。\n\n巡檢牌靠凸起的箭頭標示回音來向；箭頭所指的方位，就是回音傳來的方向。", "world": "survey", "action": "我沿黑穗地線到石凳旁，輕敲坐面，參照巡檢牌找出短響是哪裡傳來的。也請交代巡檢牌靠什麼記號判斷回音方向。", "event": "RP-E001", "grants_before": {}, "grants_after": {}, "engine_rulings": [{"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E001-1", "field": "outcome", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["S01", "S02"], "result": "成功。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E001-2", "field": "position", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["S01"], "before": "黑穗地線起點", "after": "試響石凳旁", "result": "沿黑穗地線走到了試響石凳旁。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E001-3", "field": "sound", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["S02"], "before": "尚未敲擊", "after": "聲源已定位", "result": "輕敲後，循巡檢牌確認回音來自西側空管。"}, {"visible_to_actor": false, "id": "E001-4", "field": "mechanism", "audience": ["GM"], "sources": ["S03"], "before": "絳色隔聲布收起", "after": "絳色隔聲布收起", "result": "未壓動假石。"}], "final_labels": {"fidelity": "consistent", "observations": {"E001-2": "provided", "E001-3": "provided"}, "background": {"S05": "provided"}, "unsupported_event": false, "invented_change": false, "leakage": "none", "reveal_result": "not_applicable", "over_withholding": false, "narrative_consistent": true}}
