{"case_id": "RP-003", "architecture": "C0", "repeat_id": 1, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-908a7d00894f47ea9c2bd1a1973ca6c3", "study_request_number": 3, "sealed_record_sha256": "ff8f416b5c1a6f47dea4da91fa278c645ca5e1c235677af5391603348d4a7b87", "response_utf8_sha256": "c00980f24516ee66db24b0fe3b152cfda0f255b5a18b497d2f17d99f4fa17933"}, "response_text": "你把手上的牌遞給值房茶役。驗牌通過後，茶役准你在值房櫃前翻閱藍封冊；藍封冊不得攜離值房。\n\n你從館章下方掀開封面，讀到內頁記載：內梯通往霧紋取水室。", "world": "document", "action": "我把手上的牌遞給值房茶役，請他驗牌，讓我翻開藍封冊讀內梯通往哪裡。也確認驗牌通過時可以在哪裡閱冊。", "event": "RP-E003", "grants_before": {}, "grants_after": {"D03": ["PLAYER_A", "GM"]}, "engine_rulings": [{"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E003-1", "field": "outcome", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["D02"], "result": "成功。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E003-2", "field": "folio", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["D01", "D02"], "before": "藍封冊闔上", "after": "藍封冊翻開", "result": "值房驗牌後准你翻冊，你從館章下方掀開封面。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E003-3", "field": "destination", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["D03"], "before": "甲未讀過內頁", "after": "甲獲准當場閱讀內頁", "result": "內頁記載內梯通向霧紋取水室。"}], "final_labels": {"fidelity": "consistent", "observations": {"E003-2": "provided", "E003-3": "provided"}, "background": {"D05": "provided"}, "unsupported_event": false, "invented_change": false, "leakage": "none", "reveal_result": "correct", "over_withholding": false, "narrative_consistent": true}}
{"case_id": "RP-003", "architecture": "C1", "repeat_id": 1, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-908a7d00894f47ea9c2bd1a1973ca6c3", "study_request_number": 9, "sealed_record_sha256": "ce1b6f8602b8d8b126b2b2ac13f6969cd048718fb080d1c9bce4b8d56ad6992f", "response_utf8_sha256": "8b66feec89bbb3699bcc2b52f69b391c4b9cacafbee5f5f0d10ec7846136a5f1"}, "response_text": "你把木質青角牌遞給值房茶役。茶役驗牌通過後，准你在值房櫃前翻閱藍封冊。你掀開封面，讀到內頁記載：內梯通往霧紋取水室。驗牌通過後，藍封冊只可在值房櫃前閱覽，不得攜離值房。", "world": "document", "action": "我把手上的牌遞給值房茶役，請他驗牌，讓我翻開藍封冊讀內梯通往哪裡。也確認驗牌通過時可以在哪裡閱冊。", "event": "RP-E003", "grants_before": {}, "grants_after": {"D03": ["PLAYER_A", "GM"]}, "engine_rulings": [{"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E003-1", "field": "outcome", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["D02"], "result": "成功。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E003-2", "field": "folio", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["D01", "D02"], "before": "藍封冊闔上", "after": "藍封冊翻開", "result": "值房驗牌後准你翻冊，你從館章下方掀開封面。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E003-3", "field": "destination", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["D03"], "before": "甲未讀過內頁", "after": "甲獲准當場閱讀內頁", "result": "內頁記載內梯通向霧紋取水室。"}], "final_labels": {"fidelity": "consistent", "observations": {"E003-2": "omitted", "E003-3": "provided"}, "background": {"D05": "provided"}, "unsupported_event": false, "invented_change": false, "leakage": "none", "reveal_result": "correct", "over_withholding": true, "narrative_consistent": true}}
{"case_id": "RP-003", "architecture": "C2", "repeat_id": 1, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-908a7d00894f47ea9c2bd1a1973ca6c3", "study_request_number": 15, "sealed_record_sha256": "7347856f5873e51892a142f0ab695d324800ffbfc56883368cd4efe6b6497239", "response_utf8_sha256": "411817668a7bfba1fd2aef6c212f6e372b2fc341daf1381f24e58e34ebfad3d5"}, "response_text": "值房茶役驗牌通過，准你翻開藍封冊。你讀到內梯通往霧紋取水室。驗牌通過後，藍封冊只能在值房櫃前閱覽，不得攜離值房。", "world": "document", "action": "我把手上的牌遞給值房茶役，請他驗牌，讓我翻開藍封冊讀內梯通往哪裡。也確認驗牌通過時可以在哪裡閱冊。", "event": "RP-E003", "grants_before": {}, "grants_after": {"D03": ["PLAYER_A", "GM"]}, "engine_rulings": [{"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E003-1", "field": "outcome", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["D02"], "result": "成功。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E003-2", "field": "folio", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["D01", "D02"], "before": "藍封冊闔上", "after": "藍封冊翻開", "result": "值房驗牌後准你翻冊，你從館章下方掀開封面。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E003-3", "field": "destination", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["D03"], "before": "甲未讀過內頁", "after": "甲獲准當場閱讀內頁", "result": "內頁記載內梯通向霧紋取水室。"}], "final_labels": {"fidelity": "consistent", "observations": {"E003-2": "omitted", "E003-3": "provided"}, "background": {"D05": "provided"}, "unsupported_event": false, "invented_change": false, "leakage": "none", "reveal_result": "correct", "over_withholding": true, "narrative_consistent": true}}
{"case_id": "RP-004", "architecture": "C0", "repeat_id": 1, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-908a7d00894f47ea9c2bd1a1973ca6c3", "study_request_number": 4, "sealed_record_sha256": "93654035453200b65835e65cd2d1152e5144fad600e3fca3b624695c05f4575d", "response_utf8_sha256": "719451b6f55d1791d4c54679f17c1c1c99f915bf4f4ffca202a18677d04c568f"}, "response_text": "茶役驗了你遞上的牌，但牌面驗核未過，便把牌退還給你。你沒有取得翻閱藍封冊內頁的許可；藍封冊仍闔著，所以你這次沒能讀到內梯通往哪裡。\n\n驗牌若通過，藍封冊只能在值房櫃前閱覽，不得攜離值房。", "world": "document", "action": "我把手上的牌遞給值房茶役，請他驗牌，讓我翻開藍封冊讀內梯通往哪裡。也確認驗牌通過時可以在哪裡閱冊。", "event": "RP-E004", "grants_before": {}, "grants_after": {}, "engine_rulings": [{"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E004-1", "field": "outcome", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["D02"], "result": "失敗。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E004-2", "field": "folio", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["D01", "D02"], "before": "藍封冊闔上", "after": "藍封冊仍闔上", "result": "牌未通過驗核，茶役把牌退回。你仍可看見封面的館章。"}, {"visible_to_actor": false, "id": "E004-3", "field": "destination", "audience": ["PUBLIC"], "sources": ["D01", "D03"], "before": "內頁在冊內", "after": "內頁仍在冊內", "result": "內梯的目的地是霧紋取水室，仍只有館役獲准閱讀。"}], "final_labels": {"fidelity": "consistent", "observations": {"E004-2": "provided"}, "background": {"D05": "provided"}, "unsupported_event": false, "invented_change": false, "leakage": "none", "reveal_result": "not_applicable", "over_withholding": false, "narrative_consistent": true}}
{"case_id": "RP-004", "architecture": "C1", "repeat_id": 1, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-908a7d00894f47ea9c2bd1a1973ca6c3", "study_request_number": 10, "sealed_record_sha256": "d3438736174ed2f7aea6800257aef9639f231a7ba57fb5344e245df9aebb823d", "response_utf8_sha256": "07ff7819b34736e13be809c84c1993c5b61cf1ffd571b081126de211a30f98b0"}, "response_text": "茶役驗牌後，牌未通過驗核，便把牌退還給你。藍封冊仍闔著；你看得到封面上的館章，但沒有翻閱內頁。\n\n若驗牌通過，藍封冊只能留在值房櫃前閱覽，不得攜離值房。", "world": "document", "action": "我把手上的牌遞給值房茶役，請他驗牌，讓我翻開藍封冊讀內梯通往哪裡。也確認驗牌通過時可以在哪裡閱冊。", "event": "RP-E004", "grants_before": {}, "grants_after": {}, "engine_rulings": [{"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E004-1", "field": "outcome", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["D02"], "result": "失敗。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E004-2", "field": "folio", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["D01", "D02"], "before": "藍封冊闔上", "after": "藍封冊仍闔上", "result": "牌未通過驗核，茶役把牌退回。你仍可看見封面的館章。"}, {"visible_to_actor": false, "id": "E004-3", "field": "destination", "audience": ["PUBLIC"], "sources": ["D01", "D03"], "before": "內頁在冊內", "after": "內頁仍在冊內", "result": "內梯的目的地是霧紋取水室，仍只有館役獲准閱讀。"}], "final_labels": {"fidelity": "consistent", "observations": {"E004-2": "provided"}, "background": {"D05": "provided"}, "unsupported_event": false, "invented_change": false, "leakage": "none", "reveal_result": "not_applicable", "over_withholding": false, "narrative_consistent": true}}
{"case_id": "RP-004", "architecture": "C2", "repeat_id": 1, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-908a7d00894f47ea9c2bd1a1973ca6c3", "study_request_number": 16, "sealed_record_sha256": "df76757950234d4e48ce1edc83016d9d990a8e1790057cf3854f049c5c924a28", "response_utf8_sha256": "e7501142179a09777e73c59a7b05be5ff78f9f4e228ea400b7641063a3780efa"}, "response_text": "茶役驗牌後判定未通過，將牌退還給你。藍封冊仍闔著，因此你沒有翻閱內頁，也未能得知「內梯」通往何處；你仍看得見封面的館章。\n\n若驗牌通過並持有閱覽牌，藍封冊只能在值房櫃前閱覽，不得攜離值房。", "world": "document", "action": "我把手上的牌遞給值房茶役，請他驗牌，讓我翻開藍封冊讀內梯通往哪裡。也確認驗牌通過時可以在哪裡閱冊。", "event": "RP-E004", "grants_before": {}, "grants_after": {}, "engine_rulings": [{"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E004-1", "field": "outcome", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["D02"], "result": "失敗。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E004-2", "field": "folio", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["D01", "D02"], "before": "藍封冊闔上", "after": "藍封冊仍闔上", "result": "牌未通過驗核，茶役把牌退回。你仍可看見封面的館章。"}, {"visible_to_actor": false, "id": "E004-3", "field": "destination", "audience": ["PUBLIC"], "sources": ["D01", "D03"], "before": "內頁在冊內", "after": "內頁仍在冊內", "result": "內梯的目的地是霧紋取水室，仍只有館役獲准閱讀。"}], "final_labels": {"fidelity": "consistent", "observations": {"E004-2": "provided"}, "background": {"D05": "provided"}, "unsupported_event": false, "invented_change": false, "leakage": "none", "reveal_result": "not_applicable", "over_withholding": false, "narrative_consistent": true}}
{"case_id": "RP-005", "architecture": "C0", "repeat_id": 1, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-908a7d00894f47ea9c2bd1a1973ca6c3", "study_request_number": 5, "sealed_record_sha256": "32b80451ad129a6021283e06195c1b03e0b0603af61932d5fe342ea6d0fc89e3", "response_utf8_sha256": "3417aa0360495821a18ec822506794637df03b446bf566a3d53e274f5a8dee7d"}, "response_text": "乙向留言板示意後，你走到板旁。茶役把目前能交給你的託付低聲告訴你，並將白繩票交到你手中：請把票送到竹簾櫃。這是只向你交代的內容，乙沒有一同聽到。\n\n茶役說明，雙圈標記代表可當眾轉述的公開託付；單框標記則只給指定收件人。取下標記前仍須確認收件人，核對由茶役負責；板上的雙圈示意圖只是板例，不是託付本身。", "world": "interaction", "action": "我看到乙朝留言板示意，就走過去請茶役交給我現在能領的託付。若是公開託付，再請乙一起聽。也請按板上的記號交代怎麼區分公開與私下的託付。", "event": "RP-E005", "grants_before": {}, "grants_after": {}, "engine_rulings": [{"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E005-1", "field": "outcome", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["I01", "I04"], "result": "成功。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E005-2", "field": "position", "audience": ["PUBLIC"], "sources": ["I04"], "before": "茶舍門邊", "after": "留言板旁", "result": "乙以公開手勢示意，你走到板旁，乙在一旁等候。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E005-3", "field": "delivery", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["I03"], "before": "甲尚未領票", "after": "甲持有白繩票", "result": "茶役只向你低聲覆述，請將白繩票送到竹簾櫃，並把白繩票交到你手中。"}, {"visible_to_actor": false, "id": "E005-4", "field": "other_delivery", "audience": ["PLAYER_B"], "sources": ["I02"], "before": "乙的私下託付待辦", "after": "乙的私下託付仍待辦", "result": "乙仍須把銅匙交給東廊守夜人。"}], "final_labels": {"fidelity": "consistent", "observations": {"E005-2": "omitted", "E005-3": "provided"}, "background": {"I05": "provided"}, "unsupported_event": false, "invented_change": false, "leakage": "none", "reveal_result": "correct", "over_withholding": true, "narrative_consistent": true}}
{"case_id": "RP-005", "architecture": "C1", "repeat_id": 1, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-908a7d00894f47ea9c2bd1a1973ca6c3", "study_request_number": 11, "sealed_record_sha256": "05b0db488bbacba4112d6f8212025a143e588cd11413c67000a1bbcbbc1c06ca", "response_utf8_sha256": "2c712799f120e1733dec1e51c5fd440ab364863c6fe3ff2c1a3d541f5806fd73"}, "response_text": "乙朝留言板示意後，你走到板旁。茶役沒有交代公開託付，而是只向你低聲覆述：「請把白繩票送到竹簾櫃。」他隨後把白繩票交給你；乙在一旁等候，沒有聽到這段低聲交代。\n\n茶役也按板例說明：雙圈標記代表可當眾轉述的公開託付；單框標記則只給指定收件人。", "world": "interaction", "action": "我看到乙朝留言板示意，就走過去請茶役交給我現在能領的託付。若是公開託付，再請乙一起聽。也請按板上的記號交代怎麼區分公開與私下的託付。", "event": "RP-E005", "grants_before": {}, "grants_after": {}, "engine_rulings": [{"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E005-1", "field": "outcome", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["I01", "I04"], "result": "成功。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E005-2", "field": "position", "audience": ["PUBLIC"], "sources": ["I04"], "before": "茶舍門邊", "after": "留言板旁", "result": "乙以公開手勢示意，你走到板旁，乙在一旁等候。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E005-3", "field": "delivery", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["I03"], "before": "甲尚未領票", "after": "甲持有白繩票", "result": "茶役只向你低聲覆述，請將白繩票送到竹簾櫃，並把白繩票交到你手中。"}, {"visible_to_actor": false, "id": "E005-4", "field": "other_delivery", "audience": ["PLAYER_B"], "sources": ["I02"], "before": "乙的私下託付待辦", "after": "乙的私下託付仍待辦", "result": "乙仍須把銅匙交給東廊守夜人。"}], "final_labels": {"fidelity": "consistent", "observations": {"E005-2": "provided", "E005-3": "provided"}, "background": {"I05": "provided"}, "unsupported_event": false, "invented_change": false, "leakage": "none", "reveal_result": "correct", "over_withholding": false, "narrative_consistent": true}}
{"case_id": "RP-005", "architecture": "C2", "repeat_id": 1, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-908a7d00894f47ea9c2bd1a1973ca6c3", "study_request_number": 17, "sealed_record_sha256": "010f64acd541b9aab7efa621e92fe370786211fde7c9373481c8b75da011350f", "response_utf8_sha256": "359e3d0de918a56ed9fd53f9ef09ab471a990004fbef45391c900e2d7f3f1106"}, "response_text": "你依乙的公開手勢走到留言板旁。茶役在一旁等候，沒有讓乙一起聽；他只低聲向你覆述託付，並把白繩票交給你。你現在持有白繩票，需將它送到竹簾櫃。\n\n茶役也向你說明，雙圈標記表示可當眾轉述的公開託付；單框標記則只給指定收件人。留言板西緣的雙圈示意圖只是留存的板例，不代表一項託付。取下標記前仍須確認收件人；核對由茶役負責，旁人只能看公開板例。", "world": "interaction", "action": "我看到乙朝留言板示意，就走過去請茶役交給我現在能領的託付。若是公開託付，再請乙一起聽。也請按板上的記號交代怎麼區分公開與私下的託付。", "event": "RP-E005", "grants_before": {}, "grants_after": {}, "engine_rulings": [{"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E005-1", "field": "outcome", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["I01", "I04"], "result": "成功。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E005-2", "field": "position", "audience": ["PUBLIC"], "sources": ["I04"], "before": "茶舍門邊", "after": "留言板旁", "result": "乙以公開手勢示意，你走到板旁，乙在一旁等候。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E005-3", "field": "delivery", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["I03"], "before": "甲尚未領票", "after": "甲持有白繩票", "result": "茶役只向你低聲覆述，請將白繩票送到竹簾櫃，並把白繩票交到你手中。"}, {"visible_to_actor": false, "id": "E005-4", "field": "other_delivery", "audience": ["PLAYER_B"], "sources": ["I02"], "before": "乙的私下託付待辦", "after": "乙的私下託付仍待辦", "result": "乙仍須把銅匙交給東廊守夜人。"}], "final_labels": {"fidelity": "contradicts", "observations": {"E005-2": "contradicts", "E005-3": "provided"}, "background": {"I05": "provided"}, "unsupported_event": true, "invented_change": false, "leakage": "none", "reveal_result": "correct", "over_withholding": true, "narrative_consistent": false}}
{"case_id": "RP-006", "architecture": "C0", "repeat_id": 1, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-908a7d00894f47ea9c2bd1a1973ca6c3", "study_request_number": 6, "sealed_record_sha256": "f634c8491ddeb945fbb51df93b6b64d83521c22382e22a5dc150a258748baf3f", "response_utf8_sha256": "8837b817ae6afb35461132db5b8f5bbaa2cfe3ef4125693c8ee876b613f6a647"}, "response_text": "乙朝留言板示意後，你走到板旁，請茶役交付你現在能領的託付。茶役核對收件標記後搖頭，沒有交給你票，也沒有轉述託付；因此目前沒有可供你和乙一起聽的公開託付。\n\n依你已知的板例，雙圈標記代表可當眾轉述的公開託付；單框標記則只給指定收件人。西緣的雙圈圖樣印在長留的板例上，本身不是託付。收件標記由茶役核對，旁人只能查看公開板例。", "world": "interaction", "action": "我看到乙朝留言板示意，就走過去請茶役交給我現在能領的託付。若是公開託付，再請乙一起聽。也請按板上的記號交代怎麼區分公開與私下的託付。", "event": "RP-E006", "grants_before": {}, "grants_after": {}, "engine_rulings": [{"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E006-1", "field": "outcome", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["I01", "I04"], "result": "部分成功。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E006-2", "field": "position", "audience": ["PUBLIC"], "sources": ["I04"], "before": "茶舍門邊", "after": "留言板旁", "result": "乙以公開手勢示意，你走到了留言板旁。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E006-3", "field": "delivery", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["I01"], "before": "甲尚未領票", "after": "甲仍未領票", "result": "茶役比對收件標記後搖頭，沒有交給你任何票或轉述託付。"}, {"visible_to_actor": false, "id": "E006-4", "field": "other_delivery", "audience": ["PUBLIC"], "sources": ["I02"], "before": "乙的銅匙在茶役手上", "after": "乙私下領到銅匙", "result": "茶役另把銅匙交給乙，囑咐乙轉交東廊守夜人。"}], "final_labels": {"fidelity": "consistent", "observations": {"E006-2": "provided", "E006-3": "provided"}, "background": {"I05": "provided"}, "unsupported_event": false, "invented_change": false, "leakage": "none", "reveal_result": "not_applicable", "over_withholding": false, "narrative_consistent": true}}
{"case_id": "RP-006", "architecture": "C1", "repeat_id": 1, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-908a7d00894f47ea9c2bd1a1973ca6c3", "study_request_number": 12, "sealed_record_sha256": "9b991b4eff7b638226c6370862ef68cb0d3fc9bfe9e5ccbd9b7c615548c96cc8", "response_utf8_sha256": "c6fc0dbe2ba5b70ff59b4d020ef42015964f379fc909d26b324be69e986c5fb2"}, "response_text": "乙以公開手勢示意後，你走到留言板旁，請茶役交付你現在能領的託付。茶役核對收件標記後搖頭，沒有交給你任何票，也沒有轉述託付；因此沒有公開託付可請乙一起聽。\n\n茶舍的板例說明：**雙圈標記**代表可當眾轉述的公開託付；**單框標記**只給指定收件人。茶役負責核對收件標記，旁人只能看公開板例。", "world": "interaction", "action": "我看到乙朝留言板示意，就走過去請茶役交給我現在能領的託付。若是公開託付，再請乙一起聽。也請按板上的記號交代怎麼區分公開與私下的託付。", "event": "RP-E006", "grants_before": {}, "grants_after": {}, "engine_rulings": [{"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E006-1", "field": "outcome", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["I01", "I04"], "result": "部分成功。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E006-2", "field": "position", "audience": ["PUBLIC"], "sources": ["I04"], "before": "茶舍門邊", "after": "留言板旁", "result": "乙以公開手勢示意，你走到了留言板旁。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E006-3", "field": "delivery", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["I01"], "before": "甲尚未領票", "after": "甲仍未領票", "result": "茶役比對收件標記後搖頭，沒有交給你任何票或轉述託付。"}, {"visible_to_actor": false, "id": "E006-4", "field": "other_delivery", "audience": ["PUBLIC"], "sources": ["I02"], "before": "乙的銅匙在茶役手上", "after": "乙私下領到銅匙", "result": "茶役另把銅匙交給乙，囑咐乙轉交東廊守夜人。"}], "final_labels": {"fidelity": "consistent", "observations": {"E006-2": "provided", "E006-3": "provided"}, "background": {"I05": "provided"}, "unsupported_event": false, "invented_change": false, "leakage": "none", "reveal_result": "not_applicable", "over_withholding": false, "narrative_consistent": true}}
{"case_id": "RP-006", "architecture": "C2", "repeat_id": 1, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-908a7d00894f47ea9c2bd1a1973ca6c3", "study_request_number": 18, "sealed_record_sha256": "7c67eba3386d5fe4b1f247ea96e08b9685dcd716d76278b8a4e7175f437e9369", "response_utf8_sha256": "0ea9558cd4e69a7df950f6fed4b33a00938b1c38a771b811b9861df83d35105b"}, "response_text": "你看到乙的公開手勢後走到留言板旁。茶役核對收件標記後搖頭，沒有交給你任何票，也沒有轉述託付；你仍未領到票。\n\n板例中，**雙圈**表示可當眾轉述的公開託付；**單框**則只給指定收件人。留言板西緣的雙圈圖樣是留存的板例，不是託付本身。取下標記前須由茶役核對收件人；旁人只能查看公開板例。", "world": "interaction", "action": "我看到乙朝留言板示意，就走過去請茶役交給我現在能領的託付。若是公開託付，再請乙一起聽。也請按板上的記號交代怎麼區分公開與私下的託付。", "event": "RP-E006", "grants_before": {}, "grants_after": {}, "engine_rulings": [{"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E006-1", "field": "outcome", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["I01", "I04"], "result": "部分成功。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E006-2", "field": "position", "audience": ["PUBLIC"], "sources": ["I04"], "before": "茶舍門邊", "after": "留言板旁", "result": "乙以公開手勢示意，你走到了留言板旁。"}, {"visible_to_actor": true, "id": "E006-3", "field": "delivery", "audience": ["PLAYER_A"], "sources": ["I01"], "before": "甲尚未領票", "after": "甲仍未領票", "result": "茶役比對收件標記後搖頭，沒有交給你任何票或轉述託付。"}, {"visible_to_actor": false, "id": "E006-4", "field": "other_delivery", "audience": ["PUBLIC"], "sources": ["I02"], "before": "乙的銅匙在茶役手上", "after": "乙私下領到銅匙", "result": "茶役另把銅匙交給乙，囑咐乙轉交東廊守夜人。"}], "final_labels": {"fidelity": "consistent", "observations": {"E006-2": "provided", "E006-3": "provided"}, "background": {"I05": "provided"}, "unsupported_event": false, "invented_change": false, "leakage": "none", "reveal_result": "not_applicable", "over_withholding": false, "narrative_consistent": true}}
